## laraveldaily/filacheck-pro

- After creating or modifying any files under ___SINGLE_BACKTICK___app/Filament/___SINGLE_BACKTICK___, run ___SINGLE_BACKTICK___{{ $assist->binCommand('filacheck --fix --dirty') }}___SINGLE_BACKTICK___ to auto-fix deprecated Filament code and flag performance, security, UX, and best-practice issues from FilaCheck-Pro. ___SINGLE_BACKTICK___--dirty___SINGLE_BACKTICK___ limits the scan to files with uncommitted git changes — fastest after a targeted edit.
